{"3845210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Papa Needs a Headshot", "steam_appid": 3845210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/95865c17f67994aa639ce9f4e05ad299.avif?t=1775643229\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Papa Needs a Headshot throws you into brutal combat where every bullet matters. Each freak you face needs its own brand of pain, and every shot pulls you one step closer to burying a bullet in the man who made you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t squander bullets and make each one hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/c85d287b0cd5fa8bfa593b0d1ee0069e.poster.avif?t=1775643229\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/c85d287b0cd5fa8bfa593b0d1ee0069e.webm?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/c85d287b0cd5fa8bfa593b0d1ee0069e.mp4?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/271567c294020b08e2060a395df730d4.avif?t=1775643229\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear the freaks on your warpath limb from limb. That mechanical limb isn’t just gear; it’s a goddamn force of nature. Roast mutants alive, shatter frozen skulls, or fry the masses until they smell like scorched flesh. The battlefield is your playground. Master the elements and leave nothing behind but scorched earth and a pile of broken bones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/1dd2f069ac9c5dc96da1ea0a99a9a832.poster.avif?t=1775643229\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/1dd2f069ac9c5dc96da1ea0a99a9a832.webm?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/1dd2f069ac9c5dc96da1ea0a99a9a832.mp4?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/518c42b120847f9b4e265c48230d9875.avif?t=1775643229\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush twisted and grotesque bosses to carve a brutal path through the wreckage of your bloodline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulverize and destroy every living thing before you, and rely on a son’s fury to bring down even the colossal beasts that tower over you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/f2e5af0c1a4842f1104c23d419348308.poster.avif?t=1775643229\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/f2e5af0c1a4842f1104c23d419348308.webm?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/f2e5af0c1a4842f1104c23d419348308.mp4?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/40363895360206e7a3e610a64308c378.avif?t=1775643229\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Papa Needs a Headshot is set in a nightmare dressed in gears and gunpowder. Your path is a dark one soaked in family blood, and somehow, you’ll find a way to make it even darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/8b2e809b5dce6ef9705ad3eea798a398.poster.avif?t=1775643229\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/8b2e809b5dce6ef9705ad3eea798a398.webm?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/8b2e809b5dce6ef9705ad3eea798a398.mp4?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/95865c17f67994aa639ce9f4e05ad299.avif?t=1775643229\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Papa Needs a Headshot throws you into brutal combat where every bullet matters. Each freak you face needs its own brand of pain, and every shot pulls you one step closer to burying a bullet in the man who made you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t squander bullets and make each one hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/c85d287b0cd5fa8bfa593b0d1ee0069e.poster.avif?t=1775643229\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/c85d287b0cd5fa8bfa593b0d1ee0069e.webm?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/c85d287b0cd5fa8bfa593b0d1ee0069e.mp4?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/271567c294020b08e2060a395df730d4.avif?t=1775643229\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear the freaks on your warpath limb from limb. That mechanical limb isn’t just gear; it’s a goddamn force of nature. Roast mutants alive, shatter frozen skulls, or fry the masses until they smell like scorched flesh. The battlefield is your playground. Master the elements and leave nothing behind but scorched earth and a pile of broken bones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/1dd2f069ac9c5dc96da1ea0a99a9a832.poster.avif?t=1775643229\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/1dd2f069ac9c5dc96da1ea0a99a9a832.webm?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/1dd2f069ac9c5dc96da1ea0a99a9a832.mp4?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/518c42b120847f9b4e265c48230d9875.avif?t=1775643229\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush twisted and grotesque bosses to carve a brutal path through the wreckage of your bloodline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulverize and destroy every living thing before you, and rely on a son’s fury to bring down even the colossal beasts that tower over you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/f2e5af0c1a4842f1104c23d419348308.poster.avif?t=1775643229\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/f2e5af0c1a4842f1104c23d419348308.webm?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/f2e5af0c1a4842f1104c23d419348308.mp4?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/40363895360206e7a3e610a64308c378.avif?t=1775643229\" width=700 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Papa Needs a Headshot is set in a nightmare dressed in gears and gunpowder. Your path is a dark one soaked in family blood, and somehow, you’ll find a way to make it even darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/8b2e809b5dce6ef9705ad3eea798a398.poster.avif?t=1775643229\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/8b2e809b5dce6ef9705ad3eea798a398.webm?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/8b2e809b5dce6ef9705ad3eea798a398.mp4?t=1775643229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Papa Needs a Headshot is a brutal western-steampunk FPS soaked in kin blood. Rip through flesh and bend the battlefield with your cursed metal arm. Use every bullet wisely to slaughter freaks and abominations on your warpath. Keep enduring only to put a bullet in the skull of the man who made you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/32bb40c772faa3dee42a5a0588739ff54d2703fe/header.jpg?t=1775643229", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/767c3c2e33f00464b2f229cdb797ceb4f7921032/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775643229", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/767c3c2e33f00464b2f229cdb797ceb4f7921032/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775643229", "website": "https://phewphewgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU with 2+ GHz, 4 cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Specs not finalized</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU with 3+ GHz, 8 cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3050 or Radeon RX 6500 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB